<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Feelings (Source/ColonyCouncil/Heart/). Each is fed by the mood thoughts it lists, at the size the game gives them:
    <thoughts> on the feeling's own side of mood (hard feelings by what hurts, bright ones by what helps), <feeds> with
    conditions and weights ("Prefix*" patterns, sign -1/0/1, aboutSomeone, opinionBelow/Above). Names that aren't in
    the game are simply never matched, so DLC and mod thoughts can be listed freely. A worker adds what thoughts can't
    say. A feeling never adds mood of its own; it nudges wishes, moments, dreams and strain, each at full strength only
    when the feeling is strong (intensity 20). Names, descriptions and effects are in Keyed/Rimfolk_Heart.xml
    (CC_Heart_F_{key}...). Any ThoughtDef can also join a feeling with a HeartTags mod extension.
  -->

